@host = http://localhost:5080

### Evaluate
POST {{host}}/v1/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expression": "10 - 2 * 6 / 4" }

### Explain: lists every step
POST {{host}}/v1/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expression": "10 - 2 * 6 / 4", "explain": true }

### Division by zero: 422 with errorCode, position and length
POST {{host}}/v1/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expression": "10 / 0" }

### Validate a valid expression
POST {{host}}/v1/evaluations/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expression": "10-2" }

### Validate an invalid expression
POST {{host}}/v1/evaluations/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "expression": "10 + * 3" }

### Missing expression: 400 Problem Details
POST {{host}}/v1/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
